{"n":60,"v":[["O vous qui avez cru! Ne prenez pas pour alliés Mon ennemi et le vôtre, leur offrant l'amitié, alors qu'ils ont nié ce qui vous est parvenu de la vérité. Ils expulsent le Messager et vous-mêmes parce que vous croyez en Allah, votre Seigneur. Si vous êtes sortis pour lutter dans Mon chemin et pour rechercher Mon agrément, leur témoignerez-vous secrètement de l'amitié, alors que Je connais parfaitement ce que vous cachez et ce que vous divulguez? Et quiconque d'entre vous le fait s'égare de la droiture du sentier","",[[["يَٰٓ","P","VOC|PREF|LEM:ي",-1],["أَيُّ","N","ACC",51],["هَا","P","ATT|SUFF|LEM:ه",-1]],[["ٱلَّذِينَ","N","REL|MP",7]],[["ءَامَنُ","V","PERF|VF:4|3MP",18],["وا۟","N","PRON|SUFF|3MP",-1]],[["لَا","P","PRO",2]],[["تَتَّخِذُ","V","IMPF|VF:8|2MP|MOOD:JUS",90],["وا۟","N","PRON|SUFF|2MP",-1]],[["عَدُوِّ","N","M|ACC",221],["ى","N","PRON|SUFF|1S",-1]],[["وَ","P","CONJ|PREF|LEM:و",-1],["عَدُوَّ","N","M|ACC",221],["كُمْ","N","PRON|SUFF|2MP",-1]],[["أَوْلِيَآءَ","N","MP|ACC",118]],[["تُلْقُ","V","IMPF|VF:4|2MP|MOOD:IND",159],["ونَ","N","PRON|SUFF|2MP",-1]],[["إِلَيْ","P","P",14],["هِم","N","PRON|SUFF|3MP",-1]],[["بِ","P","P|PREF|LEM:ب",-1],["ٱلْ","P","DET|PREF|LEM:ال",-1],["مَوَدَّةِ","N","F|GEN",971]],[["وَ","P","CIRC|PREF|LEM:و",-1],["قَدْ","P","CERT",22]],[["كَفَرُ","V","PERF|VF:1|3MP",37],["وا۟","N","PRON|SUFF|3MP",-1]],[["بِ","P","P|PREF|LEM:ب",-1],["مَا","N","REL",6]],[["جَآءَ","V","PERF|VF:1|3MS",40],["كُم","N","PRON|SUFF|2MP",-1]],[["مِّنَ","P","P",0]],[["ٱلْ","P","DET|PREF|LEM:ال",-1],["حَقِّ","N","M|GEN",47]],[["يُخْرِجُ","V","IMPF|VF:4|3MP|MOOD:IND",105],["ونَ","N","PRON|SUFF|3MP",-1]],[["ٱل","P","DET|PREF|LEM:ال",-1],["رَّسُولَ","N","M|ACC",32]],[["وَ","P","CONJ|PREF|LEM:و",-1],["إِيَّاكُمْ","N","PRON|2MP",418]],[["أَن","P","SUB",17]],[["تُؤْمِنُ","V","IMPF|VF:4|2MP|MOOD:SUBJ",18],["وا۟","N","PRON|SUFF|2MP",-1]],[["بِ","P","P|PREF|LEM:ب",-1],["ٱللَّهِ","N","PN|GEN",1]],[["رَبِّ","N","M|GEN",11],["كُمْ","N","PRON|SUFF|2MP",-1]],[["إِن",